{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out for an introductory conversation. Brief, practical planning and clear next steps to help you decide if we work well together.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6efe6; /* warm paper */
      --card:#fff8f0;
      --accent:#7a5a3a; /* earthy brown */
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --accent-2:#b87a52;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px;
      --max-width:980px;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      background: var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg');
      color:#2b2b2b;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45;
      padding:32px 16px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
    }
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max-width);width:100%;}
    header{
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px;
    }
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(122,90,58,0.14)}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}

    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(60,40,20,0.06)}
    .hero{padding:28px 22px;margin-bottom:14px}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:24px;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .meta a{display:inline-block;background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}

    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Session Planner */
    .planner h2{margin-top:0;color:#4b3626}
    .form-row{margin-bottom:12px}
    label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#3d2e24}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(80,60,40,0.08);background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:90px;resize:vertical}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    button.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(122,90,58,0.12)}
    .result{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fffdfb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px dashed rgba(122,90,58,0.08);margin-top:12px}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity 550ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1),transform 550ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;transform:none;opacity:1}
    }

    footer{margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* accessibility focus */
    a:focus,button:focus,input:focus,textarea:focus{outline:3px solid rgba(184,122,82,0.18);outline-offset:2px}

    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#5b4a3d;margin-top:12px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">T</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="small">A private practice offering focused therapeutic work</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="panel hero reveal" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <h1 id="contact-heading">A clear first step</h1>
        <p class="lead">If you're considering therapy, a short conversation helps clarify what would be most helpful. I offer brief planning sessions, focused intensives, and longer-term work depending on what comes up together.</p>
        <div class="meta">
          <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>
          <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email: {{EMAIL}}</a>
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
        <div class="small" style="margin-top:12px">Sessions held by telehealth within {{STATE}} and in-person by arrangement in {{CITY}}.</div>
      </section>

      <aside class="panel reveal">
        <div class="small" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Quick contact</div>
        <form id="contact-form" aria-label="Contact form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <label for="message">Brief note (what brings you here)</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message"></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="controls">
            <button type="submit">Request a brief call</button>
            <button type="button" class="secondary" id="planner-shortcut">Try the Session Planner</button>
          </div>
        </form>
        <div class="disclaimer">
          Confidentiality: communications are treated with clinical discretion. Email is not fully secure. For urgent medical or safety concerns, contact emergency services or local crisis lines immediately.
        </div>
      </aside>

      <section class="panel planner reveal" aria-labelledby="planner-heading">
        <h2 id="planner-heading">Session Planner</h2>
        <p class="small">Build a short plan to identify what might help most right now. You can copy it or paste it into an email to share before a first session.</p>

        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="concerns">Primary concerns (short list)</label>
          <textarea id="concerns" placeholder="e.g., decision fatigue, grief, pattern of avoidance"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="goals">What would feel most useful in the next month?</label>
          <input id="goals" type="text" placeholder="e.g., clearer routine, a plan for difficult conversations">
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="time">How much time can you commit?</label>
          <select id="time">
            <option value="1">A single focused session</option>
            <option value="3">Short series (2–4 sessions)</option>
            <option value="6">Ongoing rhythm (6+ sessions)</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="tone">Preferred pace or tone</label>
          <select id="tone">
            <option>Reflective and exploratory</option>
            <option>Direct skill-building</option>
            <option>A mix — both reflection and action</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="controls">
          <button id="build-plan">Build plan</button>
          <button id="clear-plan" type="button" class="secondary">Clear</button>
        </div>

        <div id="plan-output" class="result" aria-live="polite" tabindex="0">Your personalized plan will appear here after you click "Build plan".</div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
          <button id="copy-plan" class="secondary">Copy plan</button>
          <button id="email-plan" class="secondary">Open email</button>
        </div>

        <div class="small" style="margin-top:10px">Note: the planner is an aid to conversation, not a diagnostic tool. If you are in crisis or at immediate risk, please contact emergency services or a crisis line.</div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel reveal" style="grid-column:1 / -1;margin-top:18px">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">How I typically work</h2>
        <p class="small">I aim for clear agreements about goals and the work we do. Below are common pathways people choose; they're starting places we adapt together.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <div style="flex:1;min-width:220px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffdfa,#fff5ef);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
            <strong>Clarity Session</strong>
            <div class="small">A single 60–90 minute session to map concerns and next steps.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1;min-width:220px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffdfa,#fff5ef);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
            <strong>Short Track</strong>
            <div class="small">2–4 sessions focused on a defined problem or transition.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1;min-width:220px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffdfa,#fff5ef);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
            <strong>Exploratory Rhythm</strong>
            <div class="small">A longer series for deeper shifts, paced to your life.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel reveal" style="grid-column:1 / -1;margin-top:18px">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Frequently asked</h2>
        <div style="margin-top:8px">
          <details>
            <summary style="font-weight:700">How will I know what I need?</summary>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">We begin with what matters to you now. A planning conversation helps us shape a short, focused path rather than guessing long-term commitments right away.</div>
          </details>
          <details style="margin-top:8px">
            <summary style="font-weight:700">Is what I say confidential?</summary>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">Yes — with standard, ethical exceptions (risk of harm to self/others, court orders). I will discuss limits of confidentiality before we begin.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <div class="small">By contacting {{BUSINESS_NAME}} you acknowledge this is for non-emergency communication. Crisis resources: dial your local emergency services or contact the national crisis line in your area if you are in immediate danger.</div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      var reduce = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(reduce){
        reveals.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('is-visible');});
        return;
      }
      var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
        entries.forEach(function(entry){
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            observer.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      },{rootMargin:'-10% 0px',threshold:0.08});
      reveals.forEach(function(el){observer.observe(el);});
    })();

    // Session Planner logic
    (function(){
      var buildBtn = document.getElementById('build-plan');
      var clearBtn = document.getElementById('clear-plan');
      var copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy-plan');
      var emailBtn = document.getElementById('email-plan');
      var output = document.getElementById('plan-output');
      var shortcut = document.getElementById('planner-shortcut');

      function sanitize(s){return (s||'').trim();}

      function suggestPlan(data){
        var lines = [];
        lines.push('Session Planner — summary');
        lines.push('=========================');
        lines.push('Concerns: ' + (data.concerns||'Not specified'));
        lines.push('Short goal: ' + (data.goals||'Not specified'));
        lines.push('Time commitment: ' + (data.timeLabel||'N/A'));
        lines.push('Preferred tone: ' + (data.tone||'N/A'));
        lines.push('');

        // Unique recommendations (avoid direct medical claims)
        if(data.time === '1'){
          lines.push('Suggested approach: A focused clarity session to map your priorities and generate 1–2 practical next steps. This can be helpful to land on immediate actions and decide if further work is useful.');
        } else if(data.time === '3'){
          lines.push('Suggested approach: A short course of sessions concentrating on one clear theme. We make a 2–4 session agreement, name a measurable next step, and review progress mid-way.');
        } else if(data.time === '6'){
          lines.push('Suggested approach: A paced rhythm for deeper exploration and skill-building. We set flexible goals and adapt as you learn from practice between sessions.');
        }

        lines.push('Style note: ' + (data.tone||'A mixture of reflection and pragmatic tasks.'));
        lines.push('\nNext steps: If this feels right, you can request a brief introductory call via phone or email to align on scheduling and logistics.');
        lines.push('\n--');
        lines.push('Contact: ' + '{{EMAIL}}' + ' | ' + '{{PHONE}}');
        return lines.join('\n');
      }

      function collect(){
        return {
          concerns: sanitize(document.getElementById('concerns').value),
          goals: sanitize(document.getElementById('goals').value),
          time: document.getElementById('time').value,
          timeLabel: document.getElementById('time').selectedOptions[0].textContent,
          tone: document.getElementById('tone').value
        };
      }

      buildBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        var data = collect();
        var text = suggestPlan(data);
        output.textContent = text;
        output.focus();
      });

      clearBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        document.getElementById('concerns').value='';
        document.getElementById('goals').value='';
        document.getElementById('time').value='1';
        document.getElementById('tone').value='Reflective and exploratory';
        output.textContent = 'Your personalized plan will appear here after you click "Build plan".';
      });

      copyBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        var text = output.textContent || '';
        if(!text){
          output.textContent = 'Nothing to copy. Build a plan first.';
          return;
        }
        if(navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText){
          navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
            copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
            setTimeout(function(){copyBtn.textContent='Copy plan';},1600);
          },function(){
            fallbackCopy(text);
          });
        } else {
          fallbackCopy(text);
        }
      });

      function fallbackCopy(text){
        var ta = document.createElement('textarea');
        ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select();
        try{document.execCommand('copy');
          copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(function(){copyBtn.textContent='Copy plan';},1600);
        }catch(e){alert('Copy failed — you can select and copy the plan manually.');}
        ta.remove();
      }

      emailBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        var text = output.textContent || '';
        var subject = encodeURIComponent('My session plan — from website');
        var body = encodeURIComponent(text + '\n\nI am interested in discussing this.');
        var mailto = 'mailto:' + '{{EMAIL}}' + '?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
        window.location.href = mailto;
      });

      // wire contact form to open mail client with content summary (local-only)
      var contactForm = document.getElementById('contact-form');
      contactForm.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        var name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'Anonymous';
        var email = document.getElementById('email').value || '';
        var message = document.getElementById('message').value || '';
        var body = encodeURIComponent('Name: ' + name + '\nEmail: ' + email + '\n\nMessage:\n' + message);
        var mailto = 'mailto:' + '{{EMAIL}}' + '?subject=' + encodeURIComponent('Website contact: ' + name) + '&body=' + body;
        window.location.href = mailto;
      });

      // shortcut to focus planner
      shortcut.addEventListener('click',function(){
        document.getElementById('concerns').focus();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for private_practice_therapist

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — the contact + Session Planner page for the site.

What this page includes:
- Local, self-contained HTML/CSS/JS (no external assets or CDNs referenced).
- A warm, earthy visual palette with a patterned background (assets/img/pattern.svg expected locally).
- Accessible navigation linking to the site pages: index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html, contact.html.
- A scroll-triggered section reveal effect implemented with IntersectionObserver and respectful handling of prefers-reduced-motion.
- An interactive 'Session Planner' widget that:
  - Collects concerns, goals, time commitment, and tone.
  - Builds a plaintext personalized plan with suggested approaches (non-diagnostic, supportive language).
  - Allows copying the plan to clipboard and opening the native mail client with the plan pre-filled.
- A small contact form that opens the user's mail client with the message (local-only behaviour; no server).
- Confidentiality and crisis guidance included in clinician-authored tone; scope boundaries are stated.

Accessibility & progressive enhancement:
- If users prefer reduced motion, reveal animations are disabled and content is fully visible.
- Buttons, form controls, and output include keyboard focus styles and ARIA-friendly attributes (aria-live for plan output).
- All interactive features use standard browser APIs with fallbacks for clipboard where possible.

Placeholders to replace during templating:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes for developers:
- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for the background pattern; ensure that SVG exists in that path.
- No server-side behavior is implemented. Contact form and email actions use mailto: links. For production, swap to a secure backend if you need message persistence.
- The Session Planner generates plain text only; it is intentionally not a clinical assessment tool and includes a note directing people to crisis resources when needed.

How to preview locally:
- Place this file alongside the rest of the generated site and the assets folder.
- Open contact.html in a browser (double-click file or serve via a static server).

Design & copy considerations:
- Language aims to be clinician-grounded, calm, and non-prescriptive. No medical claims or guarantees are present.
- Section order and program naming intentionally differ from other templates: Clarity Session, Short Track, Exploratory Rhythm are used as framing options here.

If you need additional pages or adjustments to the planner behavior (e.g., save to JSON, integrate with booking flow), ask and I will provide an updated chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
